CloudFormations
	- instead of manuall creation we can use Template 
	- it can mange all Services
		Compute    -  EC2,Lambda
		Storage    -  S3, EBS
		Networking -  VPC
		Management Goverance - CloudFormations CloudWatch
		
		Steps:
			1.template - YAML /JSON
			2.upload 
			3.create stack / update stack / delete stack / rollback on failure service
			4.AWS create resources in correct Order [IAM ROLE - EC2 - S3]
			5.Update / delete Stack - Forgate Task
			
		Create Stack:
			Cloud formation - Stack - Create Stack:
			parameter - Key Pair | Instance Type - t2.micro nano | Location
			Mappings  - Region for IP - AMI Region Specific
			Resources - Ec2 | security Group - ports 
			Output    - new Stack | Results | Instance
			
			
		Status Cloud Formations:                                     
			 CREATE_IN_PROGRESS           Stack/resource creation is in progress          
			 CREATE_COMPLETE              Stack/resource created successfully             
			 CREATE_FAILED                Creation failed                                 
			 ROLLBACK_IN_PROGRESS         Creation failed, CloudFormation is rolling back 
			 ROLLBACK_COMPLETE            Rollback completed                              
			 UPDATE_IN_PROGRESS           Stack update is in progress                     
			 UPDATE_COMPLETE              Update completed successfully                   
			 UPDATE_FAILED                Update failed                                   
			 UPDATE_ROLLBACK_IN_PROGRESS  Update failed and rollback started              
			 UPDATE_ROLLBACK_COMPLETE     Update rollback completed                       
			 DELETE_IN_PROGRESS           Stack deletion is in progress                   
			 DELETE_COMPLETE              Stack deleted successfully                      
			 DELETE_FAILED                Stack deletion failed                    
